<title>NEW ZEALAND: Max to raise NZ$1.425 mln via placement.</title>
<headline>Max to raise NZ$1.425 mln via placement.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand's Max Resources said on Friday it had agreed to place 3.75 million fully-paid shares to an Australian-based institution and professional clients of BZW New Zealand at 38 cents/share to raise NZ$1.425 million.</p>
</text>
